OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1787087916
OL,3,CDefence boss promises to address
OL,4,Cmilitary sexual abuse 'regardless of
OL,5,Crank'
OL,7,FWatch: Director of Conduct, Equity and
OL,8,FJustice at the Ministry of Defence
OL,9,Fresponds to 'brutal' abuse of women
OL,11,FWarning: This article contains
OL,12,Freferences to sexual abuse and assault
OL,14,FThe Ministry of Defence has said it
OL,15,Fwill crack down on sexual abuse,
OL,16,Fbullying and misogyny in all ranks of
OL,17,Fthe British armed forces.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/26
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1787087916
OL,3,CDefence boss promises to address
OL,4,Cmilitary sexual abuse 'regardless of
OL,5,Crank'
OL,7,FSam des Forges, the Director of
OL,8,FConduct, Equity and Justice at the
OL,9,FMinistry of Defence (MOD), said the
OL,10,Fsexual abuse suffered by women in the
OL,11,Fmilitary uncovered by ITV News is
OL,12,F'brutal and shocking'.
OL,14,F"Defence is taking action regardless
OL,15,Fof your rank", she said.
OL,17,FMany former servicewomen told ITV News
OL,18,Fthey served within a toxic culture
OL,19,Fwhich left them feeling at risk of
OL,20,Fharm from their male colleagues every
OL,21,Fday.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/26
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1787087916
OL,3,CDefence boss promises to address
OL,4,Cmilitary sexual abuse 'regardless of
OL,5,Crank'
OL,7,FOne woman, who we are calling Abby,
OL,8,Ftold ITV News she was raped 12 times
OL,9,Fand has "lost count" of the number of
OL,10,Ftimes she was sexually assaulted
OL,11,Fduring her short career in the Army.
OL,13,FAbby, whose identity we are
OL,14,Fprotecting, was so violently sexually
OL,15,Fassaulted that she suffered serious
OL,16,Fand long-lasting physical injuries as
OL,17,Fa result.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/26
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1787087916
OL,3,CDefence boss promises to address
OL,4,Cmilitary sexual abuse 'regardless of
OL,5,Crank'
OL,7,FIf you are affected by any issues
OL,8,Fraised in this article, there is help
OL,9,Favailable on our advice and support
OL,10,Fpage.
OL,12,FAnother former soldier said she had
OL,13,F"lost count" of the number of times
OL,14,Fshe had been groped on her chest and
OL,15,Fbetween her legs.
OL,17,FOne other woman, who served in a
OL,18,Fdifferent part of the military, was
OL,19,Fsexually assaulted by a senior officer
OL,20,Fshe grew to trust and was then raped
OL,21,Fby another colleague.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/26
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1787087916
OL,3,CDefence boss promises to address
OL,4,Cmilitary sexual abuse 'regardless of
OL,5,Crank'
OL,7,FShe said she felt she was "walking
OL,8,Faround with a target on her back" and
OL,9,Fdid not feel safe at work.
OL,11,FEach of the women said they left the
OL,12,Farmed forces feeling failed, betrayed
OL,13,Fand traumatised.
OL,15,F'We know there is not one silver
OL,16,Fbullet that will solve this'
OL,18,FSam des Forges said Defence is working
OL,19,Fto address cultural issues in the
OL,20,Fmilitary but said there is 'no silver
OL,21,Fbullet' to fix problems instantly.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/26
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1787087916
OL,3,CDefence boss promises to address
OL,4,Cmilitary sexual abuse 'regardless of
OL,5,Crank'
OL,7,FAlmost 300 service personnel have been
OL,8,Fkicked out of the organisation over
OL,9,Fthe last three years as part of the
OL,10,Fzero-tolerance policy aiming to
OL,11,Ftackling unacceptable behaviour.
OL,13,F"I commend those women for raising
OL,14,Fthose horrendous and brutal
OL,15,Fexperiences that you describe", she
OL,16,Ftold ITV News.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/26
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1787087916
OL,3,CDefence boss promises to address
OL,4,Cmilitary sexual abuse 'regardless of
OL,5,Crank'
OL,7,F"We need to really understand those
OL,8,Fexperiences in order to be able to
OL,9,Fdeliver the change that actually all
OL,10,Fof us want to see in Defence", she
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,F"There's a lot of focus at the moment
OL,14,Fon the broader societal challenges and
OL,15,Fthat's why Defence is really stepping
OL,16,Finto the work that Government is doing
OL,17,Fto halve violence against women and
OL,18,Fgirls...But I think we're also not
OL,19,Fnaive that there's one silver bullet
OL,20,Fthat is going to solve this."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/26
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
