CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1787087916
OL,3,CDefence boss promises to address
OL,4,Cmilitary sexual abuse 'regardless of
OL,5,Crank'
OL,7,FIf you've been affected by the issues
OL,8,Fraised in this article and would be
OL,9,Fhappy to talk to a journalist, please
OL,10,Femail militarystories@itv.com.
OL,12,FShe argued that the Ministry of
OL,13,FDefence's latest 2025 sexual behaviour
OL,14,Fsurvey is proof that the organisation
OL,15,Fis taking issues of harassment and
OL,16,Fabuse seriously.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/26
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
