FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1787087916
OL,3,CDefence boss promises to address
OL,4,Cmilitary sexual abuse 'regardless of
OL,5,Crank'
OL,7,FThe survey results showed that 67% of
OL,8,Fwomen serving in the military reported
OL,9,Fexperiencing sexualised behaviour in
OL,10,Fthe space of a year. One in ten also
OL,11,Freported experiencing non-consensual
OL,12,Fsexual activity.
OL,14,F"I think there are very few
OL,15,Forganisations that undertake that sort
OL,16,Fof research and then put it out
OL,17,Fpublicly for public scrutiny", she
OL,18,Fsaid.
OL,20,F'Rank is not a protective cover'
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/26
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40510
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1787087916
OL,3,CDefence boss promises to address
OL,4,Cmilitary sexual abuse 'regardless of
OL,5,Crank'
OL,7,FOne woman, who we are calling Sophia,
OL,8,Fserved in the Army for decades and
OL,9,Fjoined when she was just a teenager.
OL,11,FOn one occasion, when she was a new
OL,12,Frecruit, Sophia, along with some other
OL,13,Fyoung female soldiers, were locked in
OL,14,Fa room by an instructor.
OL,16,F"We were told we can't leave unless
OL,17,Fone of us performs a sexual act on him.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G10/26
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40511
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1787087916
OL,3,CDefence boss promises to address
OL,4,Cmilitary sexual abuse 'regardless of
OL,5,Crank'
OL,7,F"He wanted one of us to give a
OL,8,Fblowjob, which one of the girls did,
OL,9,Fjust so that we could leave", she
OL,10,Fcontinued.
OL,12,FSophia said the assaults she faced
OL,13,Fcontinued to get worse as she
OL,14,Fprogressed higher up the ranks.
OL,16,FSam des Forges said the military will
OL,17,Fnot tolerate unacceptable behaviour or
OL,18,Fcriminality from any rank, adding that
OL,19,Fanyone experiencing it should "reach
OL,20,Fout".
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G11/26
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40512
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1787087916
OL,3,CDefence boss promises to address
OL,4,Cmilitary sexual abuse 'regardless of
OL,5,Crank'
OL,7,F"There have been cases where people
OL,8,Fare seeing whether it's behaviours
OL,9,Ffrom a number of years ago or whether
OL,10,Fit's recent behaviours, regardless of
OL,11,Frank", she said.
OL,13,F"Defence has taken really strong
OL,14,Faction and I think that's a really
OL,15,Fimportant message, that rank is not a
OL,16,Fprotective cover."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G12/26
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40513
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1787087916
OL,3,CDefence boss promises to address
OL,4,Cmilitary sexual abuse 'regardless of
OL,5,Crank'
OL,7,FHistorically, service personnel would
OL,8,Fgo to their own chain of command or
OL,9,Fthe military police if they wanted to
OL,10,Freport a crime like sexual assault,
OL,11,Fbut there have been calls in recent
OL,12,Fyears for an independent complaints
OL,13,Fand investigative process.
OL,15,FThe calls became louder after the
OL,16,Fdeath of teenage soldier Jaysley Beck,
OL,17,Fwho took her own life after being
OL,18,Fsexually harassed by a senior officer.
OL,19,FShe had reported the incident but
OL,20,Fsenior officers failed to investigate.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G13/26
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40514
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1787087916
OL,3,CDefence boss promises to address
OL,4,Cmilitary sexual abuse 'regardless of
OL,5,Crank'
OL,7,FThe women who have spoken to ITV News
OL,8,Falso said they felt "silenced and
OL,9,Fignored" when they tried to report the
OL,10,Fassaults and abuse they suffered.
OL,12,FSam des Forges says the organisation
OL,13,Fis working hard to ensure there are
OL,14,Fappropriate, independent routes for
OL,15,Fanyone wanting to report a crime in
OL,16,Fthe military.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G14/26
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40515
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1787087916
OL,3,CDefence boss promises to address
OL,4,Cmilitary sexual abuse 'regardless of
OL,5,Crank'
OL,7,FIn 2022, the Defence Serious Crime
OL,8,FCommand was set up as a unit where
OL,9,Fvictims can have their case
OL,10,Finvestigated independently of their
OL,11,Fchain of command.
OL,13,FSam des Forges said: "I would really
OL,14,Fencourage women to reach out when they
OL,15,Fhave been subject to those sorts of
OL,16,Fcriminal behaviours, to reach out to
OL,17,Fthe police.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G15/26
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40516
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1787087916
OL,3,CDefence boss promises to address
OL,4,Cmilitary sexual abuse 'regardless of
OL,5,Crank'
OL,7,F"Now that could be the civilian
OL,8,Fpolice, that could be the service
OL,9,Fpolice, equally the Victim and Witness
OL,10,FCare Unit...I think we're putting half
OL,11,Fa million pounds in to expand that."
OL,13,FThe military also has its own service
OL,14,Fjustice system, which the MOD says
OL,15,Fprovides fair and rigorous justice for
OL,16,Fservice personnel.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G16/26
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40517
SC,0017
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1787087916
OL,3,CDefence boss promises to address
OL,4,Cmilitary sexual abuse 'regardless of
OL,5,Crank'
OL,7,FIt operates in a similar way to a
OL,8,Fcivilian criminal court in the
OL,9,Fcivilian jurisdiction but the key
OL,10,Fdifference is a case is heard by a
OL,11,Fpanel of serving members of the
OL,12,Fmilitary rather than a jury, made up
OL,13,Fof members of the public.
OL,15,F"We don't have a backlog, so they're
OL,16,Fgoing through (the service justice
OL,17,Fsystem) at greater pace. I think a
OL,18,Ftestament to the support we provide is
OL,19,Fwe have virtually no folk who are
OL,20,Fwithdrawing from cases once they reach
OL,21,Fcourt or even during the investigation.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G17/26
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40518
SC,0018
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1787087916
OL,3,CDefence boss promises to address
OL,4,Cmilitary sexual abuse 'regardless of
OL,5,Crank'
OL,7,F"It's a low level compared to the
OL,8,Fcivilian justice system, because we're
OL,9,Fputting that support around folk and
OL,10,Fultimately we want the people who have
OL,11,Fexperienced that to get their
OL,12,Fopportunity in court to receive
OL,13,Fjustice, but also to receive an
OL,14,Felement of closure.
OL,16,F"If I look at some of the behaviours
OL,17,Fbelow a criminal threshold as well, I
OL,18,Fthink we're almost at 300 folk that
OL,19,Fhave been exited from defence based on
OL,20,Fthose sorts of behaviours in the last
OL,21,Fthree or four years."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G18/26
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40519
SC,0019
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1787087916
OL,3,CDefence boss promises to address
OL,4,Cmilitary sexual abuse 'regardless of
OL,5,Crank'
OL,7,FAll of the former servicewomen who
OL,8,Ftold ITV News of their experiences in
OL,9,Fthe military were medically discharged
OL,10,Fbecause of post-traumatic stress
OL,11,Fdisorder.
OL,13,FAlmost all of them said their poor
OL,14,Fmental health was a result of the
OL,15,Fabuse or assaults they suffered at the
OL,16,Fhands of their colleagues.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G19/26
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40520
SC,0020
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1787087916
OL,3,CDefence boss promises to address
OL,4,Cmilitary sexual abuse 'regardless of
OL,5,Crank'
OL,7,F"I went through a stage where I wanted
OL,8,Fto end my life because I didn't feel
OL,9,Flistened to", one woman, Sophia said.
OL,10,F"And now all I feel now is that
OL,11,Fwherever I go, I'm not going to be
OL,12,Flistened to".
OL,14,FAbby said: "I was medically discharged
OL,15,Ffor complex PTSD because I just. I
OL,16,Fcouldn't even go to work.
OL,18,F"I couldn't even exit my house and see
OL,19,Fmen anymore because the uniforms would
OL,20,Ftrigger me. I can never trust men
OL,21,Fagain really", she added.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G20/26
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40521
SC,0021
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1787087916
OL,3,CDefence boss promises to address
OL,4,Cmilitary sexual abuse 'regardless of
OL,5,Crank'
OL,7,FWhen asked what the military is doing
OL,8,Fto support women who have suffered
OL,9,Fabuse, Sam des Forges said the MOD's
OL,10,Fmessage is to "reach out for help".
OL,12,F"On a really simple level, we have
OL,13,Fsomething called the Call It Out Hub,
OL,14,Fwhich just provides lots of insight
OL,15,Fand access to how you can obtain that
OL,16,Fsupport.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G21/26
