OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1787087916
OL,3,CDefence boss promises to address
OL,4,Cmilitary sexual abuse 'regardless of
OL,5,Crank'
OL,7,F"But.. we are not going to ever say
OL,8,Fwe've got this solved. I don't think
OL,9,Fsociety can say it's got this solved
OL,10,Fyet. We want to learn, we want to
OL,11,Fimprove, we want to take that on
OL,12,Fboard."
OL,14,F'I want to help protect our nation and
OL,15,Fhelp protect our women'
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G22/26
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
