OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40523
SC,0023
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1787087916
OL,3,CDefence boss promises to address
OL,4,Cmilitary sexual abuse 'regardless of
OL,5,Crank'
OL,7,FWhen asked whether the military is a
OL,8,Fcareer that is safe for women, Sam de
OL,9,FForges said: "If I look at what we are
OL,10,Fdoing in Defence, the genuine way we
OL,11,Fare seeking to get after this, seeking
OL,12,Fto listen to the views of victim-
OL,13,Fsurvivors, seeking to make changes in
OL,14,Fresponse to what they are raising,
OL,15,Fseeking to continue to learn.
OL,17,F"We are not in any way suggesting
OL,18,Fwe've got all the answers. We've got
OL,19,Fto learn from third sector, from other
OL,20,Fgovernment departments, from other
OL,21,Fnations.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G23/26
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40524
SC,0024
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1787087916
OL,3,CDefence boss promises to address
OL,4,Cmilitary sexual abuse 'regardless of
OL,5,Crank'
OL,7,F"I also spend a significant amount of
OL,8,Fmy time talking to the most amazing
OL,9,Fservice women who are doing things
OL,10,Fthat, as members of the public, we
OL,11,Fdon't know about and perhaps we don't
OL,12,Fwant to know about, in terms of the
OL,13,Fdanger that they are sometimes in
OL,14,Fprotecting our nation and the
OL,15,Fextraordinary experiences they are
OL,16,Fhaving.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G24/26
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40525
SC,0025
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1787087916
OL,3,CDefence boss promises to address
OL,4,Cmilitary sexual abuse 'regardless of
OL,5,Crank'
OL,7,F"They often say to me, some of the
OL,8,Fbest friendships they have and the
OL,9,Fmost supportive friendships they have
OL,10,Fare with both their sisters and their
OL,11,Fbrothers in arms.
OL,13,F"I absolutely want to, through this
OL,14,Fwork, help protect our nation, but
OL,15,Falso help protect our women.
OL,17,F"I think we've made some significant
OL,18,Fsteps, but there's more to do, so I
OL,19,Fwould encourage folk to come along and
OL,20,Ffind out.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G25/26
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40526
SC,0026
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1787087916
OL,3,CDefence boss promises to address
OL,4,Cmilitary sexual abuse 'regardless of
OL,5,Crank'
OL,7,F"But for those women that have had
OL,8,Fthose really appalling experiences,
OL,9,Fplease reach out for support. Reach
OL,10,Fout to the police, civilian police,
OL,11,Fmilitary police.
OL,13,F"We don't want folk in our
OL,14,Forganisation who are perpetrating
OL,15,Fthese sorts of behaviours."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G26/26
